  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Assistance to the Palestinian Authority Ministry of Interior to help strengthen central accountability and over sight of the security sector.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Assistance to the Palestinian Authority Ministry of Interior to help strengthen central accountability and over sight of the security sector. is a component of Support to accountable and responsive security and justice in The Occupied Palestinian Territories reported by FCDO with a funding type of 104 - Procurement of Services and a budget of &#xa3;200,000. It works in the following sector(s): Security system management and reform, Legal and judicial development.</narrative>
